{"about_the_game":"Mazzle is a straightforward and surprisingly difficult celebration of the simple beauty of maze and jigsaw puzzles.<br><br>In this game, you need to skillfully move the puzzle pieces, find their corresponding places, and harmoniously connect the colorful parts of the maze to complete it. After that, you need to guide a small ball through the maze, collecting planets to unlock the portal to the next level, which is usually located at the other end of the maze.<br><br>Use the mouse to move puzzle pieces and the keyboard (WASD or arrow keys) to navigate through the different mazes.<br><br>In Mazzle:<br><br>\u2022 50 levels<br>\u2022 5 kinds of labyrinths<br>\u2022 Colorful space art<br>\u2022 Simple controls<br>\u2022 Calm music<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3043540/extras/1.png?t=1738888954\" />","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Level 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3043540/610878df0b64f44649776d622eb13a840e31e251.jpg"},{"name":"Level 2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3043540/21252277573ca881afd1469801fbf8a640ac91d9.jpg"},{"name":"Level 3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3043540/1d598ca9278fbb5cba4ae70629f8a908a6841b2b.jpg"},{"name":"Level 4","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3043540/5bee3c8e9709954b7332adc0fc2c4e40c9015988.jpg"},{"name":"Level 5","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3043540/a7499db4d75a32aefa8c422d609208911806e00b.jpg"},{"name":"Level 6","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3043540/e7cd27061220670113a3aa718889e2c20092b54d.jpg"},{"name":"Level 7","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3043540/419c28d6bffa23de2b5d0781a74bb3dbfe1ecfc7.jpg"},{"name":"Level 8","pat